      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAIN BEACH (5) was unplaced two starts ago then things went amiss last start when he broke and finished 17 metres away in fourth over 1800m at Globe Derby Park. Has the quality to play a major role. ULTIMATE SAFARI (8) has been a bit hot and cold and that continued last start when he finished third, beaten 2.25 metres, in a nice return to form at Port Pirie over 1609m. Should enjoy a nice smother from this draw and will be looking for a split at some stage. Meeting a deeper field this time but he has the ability to mix it with them. SIENNA BELLA (1) was out of the money two starts ago then things went amiss last start when she broke and finished a long last over 1800m at Globe Derby Park. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. This doesn't look as hard so she is capable of turning things around. JUST MILZY (2) is in the mix following a fifth at her most recent appearance over 1800m at Globe Derby Park.",
